1
00:00:45,720 --> 00:00:49,420
=No.9 Hunter=

2
00:00:49,470 --> 00:00:51,360
=Episode 17=

3
00:01:00,840 --> 00:01:01,640
Master!

4
00:01:03,159 --> 00:01:03,960
(Master!)

5
00:01:04,519 --> 00:01:06,159
(I will fulfill your final wish.)

6
00:01:06,560 --> 00:01:07,719
(I will guard Yuanzhen Sect well.)

7
00:01:08,280 --> 00:01:09,280
(I'll mend the sky and save this world.)

8
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:20,120
(The Hunter token is broken.)

9
00:01:21,159 --> 00:01:23,200
(So what if my future is ruined?)

10
00:01:24,719 --> 00:01:29,959
(I will fight for the truth)

11
00:01:29,959 --> 00:01:32,640
(and seek justice.)

12
00:02:04,639 --> 00:02:07,319
(Tomb of Sect Master Yuanzhenzi)

13
00:02:17,599 --> 00:02:18,960
Yuanchu,

14
00:02:19,599 --> 00:02:20,840
Yuanchu,

15
00:02:21,879 --> 00:02:22,840
are you alright?

16
00:02:24,439 --> 00:02:25,240
Ziyan,

17
00:02:26,120 --> 00:02:27,120
are you alright?

18
00:02:29,919 --> 00:02:31,479
After I lay Master to rest,

19
00:02:31,879 --> 00:02:34,319
I will report to Queen Zhang
about mending the sky.

20
00:02:34,960 --> 00:02:36,120
Don't worry.

21
00:02:36,960 --> 00:02:37,879
I'll be fine.

22
00:02:39,520 --> 00:02:40,759
She wants the Stone.

23
00:02:41,520 --> 00:02:43,400
As long as I'm useful,

24
00:02:43,800 --> 00:02:45,360
she won't hurt me.

25
00:02:45,560 --> 00:02:48,560
Queen Zhang is especially
interested in the Wind God Chronicle.

26
00:02:49,400 --> 00:02:50,800
I think she knows more

27
00:02:50,800 --> 00:02:52,280
than we realize.

28
00:02:53,000 --> 00:02:54,719
This is our chance

29
00:02:55,560 --> 00:02:57,439
to uncover the secret of her Twin Hands.

30
00:03:00,719 --> 00:03:01,510
Hold on.

31
00:03:01,680 --> 00:03:02,680
I will come for you.

32
00:03:07,120 --> 00:03:07,919
Yuanchu,

33
00:03:10,560 --> 00:03:11,439
don't forget,

34
00:03:17,800 --> 00:03:18,960
on the gravestone,

35
00:03:20,879 --> 00:03:23,639
make sure my name is on it too.

36
00:03:33,439 --> 00:03:34,240
I will.

37
00:03:38,800 --> 00:03:40,280
I'll always be here.

38
00:03:56,210 --> 00:04:00,277
(Son Yuanchu
and his devoted wife Shangguan Ziyan)

39
00:04:25,279 --> 00:04:26,839
Yuanchu of Yuanzhen Sect

40
00:04:27,399 --> 00:04:28,560
greets Your Majesty.

41
00:04:32,560 --> 00:04:34,199
I have a matter
of great urgency to discuss.

42
00:04:46,583 --> 00:04:48,399
Hand over the Wind God Chronicle,

43
00:04:50,000 --> 00:04:52,920
and I will spare everyone in your sect.

44
00:04:54,639 --> 00:04:55,439
Otherwise...

45
00:04:56,519 --> 00:04:57,519
Your Majesty speaks in jest.

46
00:04:59,399 --> 00:05:00,759
I cannot comply.

47
00:05:01,759 --> 00:05:04,120
The Wind God Chronicle does not belong

48
00:05:04,120 --> 00:05:06,439
in the hands of a lowly commoner.

49
00:05:07,120 --> 00:05:11,600
And the Divine Stone
should never belong to a demoness.

50
00:05:12,360 --> 00:05:13,519
In that case,

51
00:05:15,519 --> 00:05:16,360
then I

52
00:05:17,079 --> 00:05:18,439
will grant you

53
00:05:19,160 --> 00:05:20,480
death.

54
00:05:21,839 --> 00:05:24,839
Mending the sky requires
both the Stone and the Chronicle.

55
00:05:25,120 --> 00:05:26,720
Neither can be missing.

56
00:05:27,800 --> 00:05:29,240
If the Sky Rift widens,

57
00:05:29,399 --> 00:05:30,439
the mortal world will be lost forever.

58
00:05:32,839 --> 00:05:37,160
You and I will be nothing
but ash in the ruins.

59
00:05:41,759 --> 00:05:42,519
You

60
00:05:43,959 --> 00:05:45,519
dare to threaten me?

61
00:05:49,000 --> 00:05:50,240
Then I

62
00:05:50,480 --> 00:05:54,040
will simply take the Chronicle from you.

63
00:05:55,720 --> 00:05:56,519
Hmph.

64
00:05:57,000 --> 00:05:59,199
The Wind God Chronicle is a divine gift.

65
00:06:00,120 --> 00:06:01,480
If you can take it,

66
00:06:01,959 --> 00:06:04,000
then by all means,
use it to seal the sky

67
00:06:04,399 --> 00:06:05,519
and save all beings.

68
00:06:07,800 --> 00:06:10,519
So you came prepared.

69
00:06:11,360 --> 00:06:12,959
You think you can fight me?

70
00:06:13,920 --> 00:06:14,720
Hmph.

71
00:06:15,800 --> 00:06:16,920
How foolish.

72
00:06:19,480 --> 00:06:20,839
Your Twin Hands have the power

73
00:06:20,839 --> 00:06:21,800
to extract the Divine Stone

74
00:06:21,800 --> 00:06:23,759
from Shangguan Ziyan's body.

75
00:06:24,279 --> 00:06:26,360
Then I can use it to mend the sky.

76
00:06:26,519 --> 00:06:27,319
Nonsense.

77
00:06:30,040 --> 00:06:31,680
If the Twin Hands are used that way,

78
00:06:31,680 --> 00:06:33,160
I will lose my hands forever.

79
00:06:33,720 --> 00:06:35,800
Why would I
care about a demoness's fate?

80
00:06:41,519 --> 00:06:42,800
The seal will happen soon.

81
00:06:43,240 --> 00:06:44,639
The demoness will be sacrificed.

82
00:06:47,720 --> 00:06:48,600
Yes.

83
00:06:50,279 --> 00:06:51,439
Until the seal is done,

84
00:06:51,800 --> 00:06:53,360
if you want to keep your tongue
and your freedom,

85
00:06:54,000 --> 00:06:55,560
you will not leave this place.

86
00:07:29,319 --> 00:07:33,319
(Why does Queen Zhang
look exactly like my godmother?)

87
00:07:37,199 --> 00:07:39,120
(The one I've been longing for,)

88
00:07:40,480 --> 00:07:41,839
(in this human realm,)

89
00:07:42,839 --> 00:07:44,720
(is also the one who wants me dead.)

90
00:07:49,079 --> 00:07:50,160
(This world is)

91
00:07:51,279 --> 00:07:53,920
(absurd and cruel.)

92
00:08:14,199 --> 00:08:17,120
Your Majesty,
I will recite the Wind God Chronicle

93
00:08:17,759 --> 00:08:18,680
and link the minds.

94
00:08:18,680 --> 00:08:20,639
Then you can use the Twin Hands
to mend the sky.

95
00:08:22,240 --> 00:08:23,680
Remember what you promised me.

96
00:08:24,639 --> 00:08:27,720
Release her after the sky is mended.

97
00:08:30,839 --> 00:08:33,919
You want me to swear before the world?

98
00:08:34,120 --> 00:08:35,039
After all,

99
00:08:35,519 --> 00:08:37,360
you are a disciple of Yuanzhen Sect.

100
00:08:37,960 --> 00:08:40,279
And yet you've fallen for a demoness

101
00:08:41,759 --> 00:08:43,120
so deeply?

102
00:08:46,080 --> 00:08:47,159
A promise is a promise.

103
00:08:49,639 --> 00:08:50,879
A sovereign's word is law.

104
00:08:57,159 --> 00:08:59,399
(I once imagined that one day,)

105
00:09:01,679 --> 00:09:03,919
(you would walk toward me step by step,)

106
00:09:06,039 --> 00:09:08,080
(in front of the whole world,)

107
00:09:11,039 --> 00:09:12,399
(and take my hand.)

108
00:09:14,879 --> 00:09:16,120
(Defying all judgment.)

109
00:09:17,240 --> 00:09:18,360
(Living freely.)

110
00:09:24,279 --> 00:09:25,440
(I never expected...)

111
00:09:29,159 --> 00:09:30,120
Gods, bear witness.

112
00:09:33,039 --> 00:09:34,159
The Divine Stone, take its place.

113
00:09:36,679 --> 00:09:37,960
Let all beings see.

114
00:09:40,080 --> 00:09:41,399
Mend the sky and save the world.

115
00:10:33,360 --> 00:10:34,799
I have received heaven's mandate

116
00:10:36,039 --> 00:10:37,519
to rule the realm.

117
00:10:38,759 --> 00:10:42,440
I shall claim the Divine Stone
and the Wind God Chronicle,

118
00:10:43,639 --> 00:10:45,399
and personally mend the sky.

119
00:10:46,159 --> 00:10:47,480
To bring peace to the realm

120
00:10:48,720 --> 00:10:50,159
and blessings to all.

121
00:11:26,850 --> 00:11:30,778
♪I drink the rain of this mortal world,
and seek the path I chose♪

122
00:11:31,050 --> 00:11:34,223
♪How much sorrow and joy have I known?♪

123
00:11:34,264 --> 00:11:37,778
♪With this flesh and blood,
I chase the distant light♪

124
00:11:37,964 --> 00:11:40,898
♪Just to see clearly
the memories of this drifting life♪

125
00:11:41,178 --> 00:11:47,948
♪Let the wind sweep away
this heavy air of sorrow♪

126
00:11:48,594 --> 00:11:55,282
♪Do not forget the tangled paths
that you and I have crossed♪

127
00:11:56,188 --> 00:11:59,858
♪Let towering waves come crashing down;
I'll fight against the tide♪

128
00:11:59,968 --> 00:12:03,658
♪I shatter
the hollow fate they wrote for me♪

129
00:12:03,830 --> 00:12:10,064
♪With a heart free of regret,
I'll face the heavens and earth♪
